  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "兵征大宛，北出玉關。與胡寇戰，平城道西。七日絕糧，身幾不全。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b356d1f42b67ee679f1cd20a40e31bcc3fb8f1cec7552ad2ad21230ee73d9fff",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:622b8a36600434adf4c3a467196f323eef462f2ab3080d32f336257aa45d96b9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "汎汎栢舟，流行不休。耿耿寤寐，心懷大憂。仁不逢時，復隱窮居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:812f1bb0f6edd3d7d46a7f9c49b0d1427104f034bf92f15b2a0e5794bfeb6bd5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:40b2f6814b3a3604ff6e6e2d946b47029aa2214f3bc17dbf9557877b9c50e852"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "採薪得麟，大命隕顛。豪雄爭名，天下四分。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5d476219c1339cb5cfc895054543c741aacac9360ad58ab82eca6c857df869b4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6ee368b393d41c0acea8efdc382dd56330622e2e39754343ca70c91cd1f850e8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "山崩谷絕，大福盡竭。涇渭失紀，玉歷盡已。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7b8463628e8100c5a16957beb1cfd6cc9c45ed1fcd6c4601cd3e5f517d687ce2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a081e9dcc44e9efdefa7971cde013b6c9c5fc261a08d68bdabab82b3943c4141"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "夏臺羑里，文王所厄。鬼侯輸賄，商王解合。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4a3abe04bd3b8b6f0cc4cc0a076d4baa385b0cbae3ab61fdde96b9c9a225329e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d480eb422880ab7120955e2ab45ad901fb86d573e750e56bb6cfd212c9356ba6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "泥津汙辱，棄捐溝瀆。所共笑哭，終不顯錄。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:575c446f9f7a78af7721b9b672a6fd5360f139bbe788f7b72d58107b610bf0e3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b7ef575e0eefb000a7d7c1ea496fabeb965faed9de582b4c29a77f826defc58f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "李梅冬實，國多盜賊。擾亂並作，君不得息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:988a955816c120d3a2b1b52b0858e3543395efef298ca36439ff8262f6a38934",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8008e2e137eccd8df1abb6203747e1fe4ef56d32c80fa89d375b28ba98a30f55"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "獐鹿逐牧，飽歸其居。反還次舍，無有疾故。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:995339fa67871804c2688a518c71334b8c1ef0107f960db9eff60f347471c50a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eb2c1b9ab774b62cd29d5439e9aabd01bebb09763b42b5efd8845c7a6b2f0b54"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "夾河為婚，期至無船。淫心失望，不見所歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d952a86d588d741e777e21452967122d461b28638223f7cc9323efdc54c411ba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3ecd87cb5c38bab6c62ec388f3556de8416dabe1fd8c163e9fbaa13aa5cfe5f3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "百足俱行，相輔為強。三聖翼事，王室寵光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2fb3555fcd69bcbeccc704e865ffceb4b51aabeb55c0fff94b03dff45a63f907",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4221fcdd64d0e99b6d7af72fc92693523f255bc3f6c2f33822107d65a86a5469"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "坐位失處，不能自居。調攝違和，陰陽顛倒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7cae38d8cadc330a0889bee4ed7a26416b0af4cf024c1d37cbf2079bc01b0bc3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9c60e27cfbd5549b3bf4f351c60ce1d7345c2b917bd4f378100cc7137cb3cdf1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "登几上輿，駕駟南遊。合從散橫，燕秦以強。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:63148b17c0d03a0e88ea280a22f72c4b0e455452eebafe656bd6b98dd2959790",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:58d682466dd7b6b5b6c95afd596cfc64e12e824a9dafdeafec60673bda1f5501"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "三系維弩，無益於輔。域弱不守，郭君受討。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:81b066a87588f6ac823451b38f757faba9ce122f44b6cd4159b5222ca2b0537f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d0ed9a88bbc43c6b0630d7a6f88f214cd32fdce101190545d7d55fbc047fda03"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "河伯大呼，津不得渡。船空無人，往來亦難。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3522d8a724d190eefeaa29e531580f9266ba392d690f96be68212dff24918714",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1c212f3cca055169c0d898fd6d583ede1707fecf4d814197a73ee374f2ee0d8e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "甘露醴泉，太平機關。仁德感應，歲樂民安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f12878a0d4b2376862f97ec8814a41acc3e8873546d6852b7355f717159eb188",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3470f5fbb8955747676dfa44a292e438454755f30e88f79f7bf02df9d64cbe92"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "重茵厚席，循高採藿。雖躓不懼，後反其處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bdb5d41def48163f3c8a3a972747f869c2a6109d316cd602fdf7aabb7bb3886c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7c68b0479cd87e687c9c50a5f1c1aa99a09dc3fc9a3ea0bd24e554faf5d8c323"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "太乙駕騮，從天上來。徵我叔季，封為魯侯。無有凶憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:be8610e74566f6cd0f90fbcbe8e599bfca811a45ab5a29b2958b37a0f98870f6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6d6124e808678f5fbce4595c45330d7a9184246bc53d1419685bec3a541d44da"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "南已大安，石斛戟天。所指不已，已老復一。將耋乃嫁，墟弊室舊。更為新家。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e279e7cbc5c9d04e907cd9ac2babb332ae3155b7fb48ffa4d1e983ec22b7d217",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b819f2882dc79ad59c248ee01d927628ebb2e044522145599eda3f486d26b20d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "家給人足，頌聲並作。四夷賓服，干戈韜閣。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f6445eadb2fc9b599b787341e55d6a2ce6d8bddd65f35036a77e3c6073e922dd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c72af1e8e756c9e3ac02df208a3af89089585e84eec214c25c6a64ee228cf3bb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "東鄰嫁女，為王妃后。莊公築館，以尊主母。歸于京師，季姜悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3848d19aaa3fa58f2071d44c286575bdc17a1cfaed6fabde40b377af9e8ba38d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aafb698284eec263156924d550e9dcd8464c4f388497992074fbaddf4a4dfd6c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "陳媯敬仲，兆興齊姜。營丘是適，八世大昌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e364bf6056a7cca2ba4c420b729427fb9f56851fd665d216c90d83e985929fd6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b2019fde75a07f874362d81706a49a2eab226b1f6084f1f6faa8b0ae912a14c4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "路多枳棘，步刺我足。不利旅客，為心作毒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a7baf6e5882d31dc805c36ae300f76a508fafb53ee0696d2bda2e05e385f5fb7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dca6d263900f80d6dc089138001f74b63022035639546540ce4616ddc40f4e6c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "天官列宿，五神室屋。空門完堅，君安其居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:366367c86919938a94a863a507a4e27ed5d07513236aee3d91dc4fe7787e0bc9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7882e9f15bd40dc7c5ce282a687d08c4256731dc1a2f9970fcb797c5da719a04"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "牧羊稻園，聞虎呻喧。懼畏惕息，終免禍患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:954919546254941e324a9d2b3dc6c808b928bdeb4d4571807e64b1d5d734902c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:644b091d5ae3abd304f992a5d318c8aa914613502c86877eee3f363c1fe99b7e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "鳴條之災，北奔大胡。左衽為長，國號匈奴。主君旄頭，立尊單于。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:01c38c18a51ba1f2cbd87ec240af90e9668bdca4af3531a7633b92f00626b4fe",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:adf0bf23368d063e5a007ab535c54fd2fbb807cb01c5397ff485b4ecb40e1595"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "尅身潔己，逢禹巡狩。錫我玄珪，拜受錫佑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4fbb6b2dc8094f38f3f4fc7f678afdc9a543ef74eafa1ee89050fb9dca657cf6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c4382e05157cce20143f2f0e6e9a9a08092f13a7b6f77d6bc33d992f6a7373bf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "冬華不實，國多盜賊。疾病難醫，鬼哭其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5955464854ba1eaec228d6ec87e00c85f4434c601499c80c32d9ad3d308bbfa8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:04b07e8dc868ed56259fed9eace6fc1b37e10f946722eb3adf101d7969019362"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "襄送季女，至於蕩道。齊子旦夕，留連久處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7938dffe26ee37c24b0f43acbbc96b11c9617cefa8974ac400233824bfe820d3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8c75b301c799e09d36043a86904e17bfd286567d377f38ff3b777fd161adf656"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "朽根倒樹，花葉落去。卒逢火焱，隨風偃仆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8b981813ee2dbae3af329500bf2ad6bea268d15b9eb48084325e5639c09d3551",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cbe805d5dd931f2ecf59f62fcc452539a3b948471f1fbf28b6ab2df722fdf7d0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "陰變為陽，女化作男。治道得通，君臣相承。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:694c2468d0780014c1d70367be5a55b60e9bd90c3f6aae0f39bac41b81e93f65",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6420733bf04312952a24e99f99f1d25f2dec24d77b8ca58ef7ecadfb680fe284"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "炎絕續光，光滅復明。簡易理得，仍成乾功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:efcd2cd5091974504e81bb0376e8002369982621e01041bbe28ae4da5bc6694c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d8dc2ce53554f3f5d631554cd6fce93bf0edaeeef6ccf767c10be668a239cbc3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "多載重負，捐棄于野。王母誰子，但自勞苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5dd7a0446b69c078bb5370d58f1f2ca38ff7871efab07dd166a5a63c0b52812a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3feb23bd35b74c0620224ab3290489b4bb44f2751b7987d68d7b810817b9c724"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "江河海澤，眾利安宅。可以富有，飲御嘉客。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4d9017fd28fcbb42d1c54fe23777dadae4c121f7beb360d4be761dea12d9dc73",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e8821fbc53bb218488c49f36fd911111fa01fd284d8aab8810689af39a85c90e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "冬採薇蘭，地凍堅難。利走東北，暮無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:91770689a54f339dea4afe4e11223ddd1988792a72197aac15cf7d5f591742e7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b8a42e62589d4b0eb39b2c1a712d075a5fbfe021f1e819d3d3edb045e37d5954"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "烏鵲嘻嘻，天火將起。燔我室屋，災及妃后。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0f4ed254c71c6e59d751539e0ac64123613d8a4f611e469e891f3849e4c17884",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0f809074d7b7356a3f4a6d27fa5d65b4a9404655bb8025291613c4d1dc6828a7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "蠆室蜂戶，螫我手足。不可進取，為身害咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bac144bd4868c6895fa741aba0f21934c1a428c94c7c9ff7ff99291bea47deb6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:420d5ee17c85cf95c5316e7a974540213cf9aece57027f322cc1b345e1710c55"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "崔嵬北嶽，天神貴客。溫仁正直，主布恩德。開示不已，蒙受大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8398ca61403997fb7e88729d8f1e78a2cacf2b8b0873f243de83beb4bd47fb99",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:412a6a8a81e4bffc9c5b038e60678099705172e63f6463d08b5af0d87b6a7fe8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "伯蹇叔盲，莫與守牧。失我衣裘，代己除服。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ab95c60925faedfec246b80f62485fc4b483196131d9b00066b32b1da3b44972",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3c78dc1b091888dbf70f6e0364f643e7b953f8d6e1de166d97c60a6ecedd593d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "為季求婦，家在東海。水長無船，不見欣歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:01f7074f5b54d1f307fcc91f7eff3522aba5f543d5440be56fd884ebb1e282cb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a567f62eacc7916f859229cfee17981f72a43d31c83c4caf82275168fc9c8eee"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "山陵丘墓，魂魄失舍。精神盡竭，長寢不覺。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6813c802d0d1a940c4f305a0570a49807a1c910fc8fc973fb7694cbbc0133adf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3706bf1cb91f3abbb0e00558937e3eb196864f2198cf183d2ed3ea8c175df586"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "踦牛失角，下山傷軸。失其利祿，過在誰孰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:815577acbf6cff7aa36d7d0079d29889964fed603d4638b4f76fc2d0ffba01ce",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0463743ba2858a7ba70721c8747b7684bef06373fc26f2fee528b5c2b26992a7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "水載船舟，無根以浮。往來溶溶，心勞且憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ce2a0ef1709318f9a0f026caf66a5b9093297e7b710d2da3f138157665551962",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c12445b9cdf1beed40337d635d1ad05ecbbaefeb27398dcfafa73dbc8f4b67a3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "有鳥來飛，集于古樹。鳴聲可惡，主將出去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6520dae0c69273780e0d40aec67cf892c6b717b6b3e928bb809cd963a648b2a8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:64f213fd3c8448442f9409711ec5251911879b5ec5284075a581acde68ecd3fa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "東徙不時，觸患離憂。井泥無濡，思叔舊居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:02e7f6bed21220c1b7656654c0116d36ced989b8470e5f45f217bf4d3b31e573",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:de972d3c9dca7e70411c0e39121b833f81869d9cbfdbdcaf0bfdae2dcd58788d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "黃帝所生，伏羲之宇。兵刃不至，利以居止。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f029f86130863b247ab7c7b69a2cf0ec73a529e2adc61ad29b0a9a34ba23467d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0728eb454efb8079e862cbd6d632c7c926d25214827a3c4cc629e4f649a0a35b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "東山拯亂。處婦思夫。勞我君子，役使休止。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1b2495a2a5356deaaf59909d431615f2bae98420253f4d4646c59c7766b3570c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:efd99b8e59b80665d59a696cd17d7c3aed2830700522e3fb37a9d42fb52dbfde"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "跛躓未起，失利後市。不得鹿子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e618965c42d5f8013ccf5d8d3f62b341aaf876030edd2c1df040c4891d1cad35",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:54deea5fd749ecd263fe4fd373ecaff4480905e15fe2562358b51d46d40af77d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "大蛇當路，使我畏懼。湯火之災，切近我膚。賴其天幸，趨於主廬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e4e4cf63751cd485a42af27cda88afb6a4594f4a5a5bbdbc37ebd15720e3d216",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3b5c3f992c12db90480eccce57d652e2a31a9d29e37895b5b6e99bbb5d163c65"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "從容長閒，遊戲南山。拜祠祀神，神使免患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:01cf35e6249971932b2c63f46b2f94f20e634d4c314ea1c4ac7d2173db2e3d02",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:62a2cff2c55b5d67c4187eab4272b110eef5b39652ca635485841e9af2e23173"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "區脫康居，慕仁入朝。湛露之歡，三爵畢恩。復歸野廬，與母相候。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0251d3ab6462c70eaafbfe4bb9c09007ccff98271e057a6ad6e86ae380c66582",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:150489e03108e15bfe3595032153b57d9defb4f7202f637a1fa45ee9cf4f0ef0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "龜鱉列市，河海饒有。長財善賈，商季悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6233759df32fa75a77f29dce884020548d11885cc3d729a1ff7bfc1e14a3862d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3ff21445e008d90f2794fbf695b4c054997db0cceabc0b894f3badac8ee6ad0d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "年常蒙慶，今歲受福。三伏採芑，出君有得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c2ba09da201909398ecf3e62cce3a0133f37b32d53468137fc34266773ddab53",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fc82b63a76788ebf57547565a8c80e5d29ee561feff11d0ab2099a1f6421c281"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "二人俱東，道路爭訟。意乖不同，使我凶凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c0b8b82cbec893db293f94cc2bf040d36f39cc0dd5552c2a2c818c3449383e5d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9b4d58ab7982553aecb9ae916fa9a714d3d7c41bc574a24e6327c3dec4427262"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "樹栽藿豆，為鹿兔食。君不慎護，秋無收入。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:54a4a4f4363b7edc4a723790c3da586c04c47dad82b82b7e9479c056dc14d17e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ebb38e6ad4f0b6d2d32b7e16cba4c1ba6fc830f65a9f4e7b8aa53030aeab314e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "黃鳥悲鳴，愁不見星。困於鷙鸇，使我心驚。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9c8ad6f4e7c5306be9aa37b4eba9aa6d12cba81b0abd5fe456dde58fa0017cab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a555d87f3a830291704e10fc21886cfc673544d9d5c4b91020ba4d0f96bed416"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "雙鳧俱飛，欲歸稻池。經涉萑澤，為矢所射。傷我胸臆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e4e098caa9ab31ab7c8ea96485e22bb792142169f3e22b99f45aabbe2d12c56d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f0e4985e869ab9042de7e37938be98ae2d6713d7a8ca959670a6fcf88942512f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "久客無休，思歸故鄉。霖雨盛溢，道未得通。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1152f962f6aa1dd17e52f8a95a8ad816b43702ed010418ad4311a67c79c5384a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b4a372f9d665192def03d232171484e1a66c4ea6aa8c042a63af964e3d0b7a80"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "道路僻除，南至東遼。衛子善辭，使國無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c96f7de35ab0c8ee8a3fc68df5ec8b205c84d422c8d17583270270573388be8d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fd58b4f2c6fcdc8a4ef2f2df1270a161ea38a47af02ce4f1ed736aa01ad20fd4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "同枕共袍，中年分去。價少無利，獨居愁思。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:10634e57c62c7fbd3bf76cc1580c86ec267f0a2eb74c985a8fd9c2fec1ea2179",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:49e992f4ed173d280344f1b9e4a04ae3c09b8c0068bedd6413ca2b12c5bcb00c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "眾神集聚，相與議語。南國虐亂，百姓愁苦。興師征討，更立賢主。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2fc3e874fbd40c3b3ed69267c52eedb3ef374bc0feba0d293e94d2dc6d73c20d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6fe7cb360cf9c59ba95b8e4d85b80b309be539e4f164fe05ca88c4afaa8384d5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "北陸閉蟄，陰伏不出。目盲耳聾，道路不通。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b99c7478962ec7c764cae1593c4cb085a83cfb2793ed6d8447442cdcda295da0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ea78d379de96ac7ac0c7ca1f0638e087c0b050b813231f9e0415c0f9f17d1181"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "痴狂妄作，心誑善惑。迷行失路，不知南北。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eb7bd12376c8c065b39817268d21bcd99e9f1beb6babdc3f54014f94faac56ec",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:841d49d7f25b4b72733fff063f7a4b09642f3523e116eb65d56d963218988440"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "棟隆輔強，寵貴日光。福善並作，樂以高明。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:473efa929eb0903ef7bc92443709b99d719c5e459a4720109970cf9fb797de51",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c518c63193e5513c578ab7041d7bbd4a1ff9b5c2ef820f405d6eaabcb2aadefa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 3,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "愛我嬰女，牽衣不與。冀幸高貴，反曰賤下。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:34ccc0beb122540de9310a013572bba3919d422456d03fde66052a7a34a04024",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6c9664765ae5420490b64f4ad11dae4e59cd48e980a86a4eae340eede97a3a82"
    }
  ]
}
